## Instalacija

U root direktoriju projekta:

```bash
# Runtime zavisnosti
uv pip install -r requirements.txt
# (Za testove)
uv pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
```

> Alternativa bez uv:  
> `pip install -r requirements.txt` i (opcionalno) `pip install -r requirements-dev.txt`.

**Virtualno okruženje (ako koristiš pip):**
```bash
python -m venv .venv
# macOS/Linux:
source .venv/bin/activate
# Windows PowerShell:
.\\.venv\\Scripts\\Activate.ps1

pip install -r requirements.txt
```

